  "bio": "Immerse yourself in the artistry of Old Tradition Tattoo, where time-honored techniques meet modern creativity amidst the vibrant pulse of Hollywood, Los Angeles. Since 2015, this custom electric tattoo studio has been crafting exceptional pieces in traditional, black & gray, and illustrative styles—garnering a reputation for 'Tatuajes Chingones' (awesome tattoos). Book your session to join the legacy of ink where every stroke and shade is a testament to timeless expression.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Los Angeles, California, United States",
